{
  "_readme": [
    "Media library for the 20-Year Test. Keys match the career ids in js/presets.js,",
    "plus the _brand block used by the intro, outro and title cards.",
    "",
    "A value is EITHER a path relative to tools/20-year-test/media/ OR an absolute URL.",
    "These ship as URLs on the generator's CDN so the library works immediately. To make",
    "it work offline, download each file into media/stills/ and replace the URL with the",
    "filename - nothing else changes.",
    "",
    "Anything null falls back to the procedural background, so a half-filled library is",
    "never a broken page.",
    "",
    "still : a 16:9 photograph used as a slide background, heavily scrimmed",
    "clip  : a short silent loop used the same way, for beats that want motion",
    "",
    "All stills below are AI-generated (Higgsfield soul_2, 2k, 16:9). They are",
    "illustrative backdrops, not photographs of real people or real businesses."
